              <h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">
                A Sample Content Calendar Table We Deliver
              </h2>
              <p class="text-gray-600">
                The standard structure filled per topic cluster: title, goal, keyword, format and publish date
              </p>
            </div>
            <img
